# Exception: the secret_store golden fixture. Its keys are test-only material
# that encrypts the literal "python-fixture-secret" and protect nothing — but
# without them committed, the Rust↔Python decryption test is unrunnable on any
# machine but the one that generated it. Regenerate with
# scripts/internal/gen_secret_store_fixture.py.
!crates/yu-server/tests/fixtures/secret_store/data/
!crates/yu-server/tests/fixtures/secret_store/data/**
# hash_backfill_state.json is written at the repo root by
# core/scan/hash_backfill.py's _state_path() (two dirs up from core/scan/),
# not under core/ — the old pattern here never matched it.
/hash_backfill_state.json
